Looking at this problem, I need to determine whether the maximum number of perfect matchings in a genus $g$ balanced bipartite graph (with $n$ vertices per color class) is $2^{O(n \log g)}$ in the regime $k = 2$ (where $g = \Theta(n^2)$).

